  "id": "genocide",
  "term": "genocide",
  "definition": "Genocide is a large-scale atrocity, such as the Holocaust or the Rwandan genocide, that has devastating effects on both individuals and communities. In mental health contexts, it is associated with profound and long-lasting psychological harm, including elevated rates of post-traumatic stress and depression among survivors decades later.",
